{"set_num":66,"set_name":"2026年浙江事业单位上","questions":[{"q_num":1,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>均超过的有2020年、2021年、2022年、2024年，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":2,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>水龙头出口额占卫生洁具出口额：2024年≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">605000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1560000</span></span>≈40⁻%，2019年≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">438000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1520000</span></span>≈30⁻%，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":3,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>平均每吨出口价格：塑料浴缸≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">70000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">148000</span></span>≈0.5⁻，淋浴房≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">29000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1500000</span></span>＜0.5，坐便器盖圈≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">42000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">107000</span></span>＜0.5，水箱配件≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">41000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">64800</span></span>＞0.6，水箱配件单价最高，所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":4,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>卫生陶瓷出口总额的5%≈511000×5%=25550，大于该值的有美国、越南、马来西亚，3个国家，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":5,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>美国占比≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2849</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11035</span></span>≈28.5%-28.5%×10%≈25.6%，观察选项，只有D选项网格部分略大于<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">1</span><span class=\"frac-den\">4</span></span>，所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":6,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>总量=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">部分</span><span class=\"frac-den\">占比</span></span>，出口总量≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">280</span><span class=\"frac-den\">51.2%</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">280-6</span><span class=\"frac-den\">51.2%-1.2%</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">274</span><span class=\"frac-den\">50%</span></span>=548，进口总量≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">250</span><span class=\"frac-den\">57.6%</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">250+12</span><span class=\"frac-den\">57.6%+2.4%</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">262</span><span class=\"frac-den\">60%</span></span>≈437,548-437＞60，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":7,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>出口单价=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">出口金额</span><span class=\"frac-den\">出口量</span></span>，使用平均数增长率公式，出口单价同比增速=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">6.4%-29.2%</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1+29.2%</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">-23%</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1.292</span></span>＞-25%，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":8,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>一般贸易出口额现期=37.4×51.5%≈（37.4+1.6）×（51.5%-1.5%）=39×50%=19.5，一般贸易进口额现期=111.7×32.7%≈32.7%+32.7%×10%≈36，两者基期和≈19.5+36-19.5÷9+36×2.2%≈55.5-2+1，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":9,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>观察图表，进出口额相加超过25亿的有3月、4月、5月，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":10,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>先观察折线图，第一个月最高，第二个月最低，代入选项，出口金额3月增速明显高于2月，排除A选项，6月增速低于4月，排除B选项；再看进口金额，2月负增长明显低于3月，排除C选项，所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":11,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>使用拉平思维，<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">铁路客运量</span><span class=\"frac-den\">民航客运量</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2313</span><span class=\"frac-den\">247×（1+4.5%）</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2313</span><span class=\"frac-den\">247×（1+4.5%）</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2313</span><span class=\"frac-den\">257</span></span>≈9，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":12,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>10月4日公路型客运量3523人，环比下降1.5%，10月3日比3523多一点，排除AB，D多的太多接近5%，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":13,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>方法一：使用线段法思维，增速差不大，使用现期比代替机器比，<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">24350</span><span class=\"frac-den\">3523</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">24000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">3500</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">48000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">7000</span></span>≈7倍，6.2%-2.5%=3.7%，3.7%÷7≈0.5%，6.2%+0.5%=6.7%，所以选择B选项，方法二：使用线段法思维+代入法，增速大于6.2%，排除A选项，假设增速为C选项7.2%，7.2%-6.2%=1%，6.2%-2.5%=3.7%，非营业性是营业性的3.7倍，远小于<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">24350</span><span class=\"frac-den\">3523</span></span>，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":14,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>比较下降比例可以比较<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">现期</span><span class=\"frac-den\">基期</span></span>，铁路≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">1800</span><span class=\"frac-den\">2300</span></span>，水路≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">190</span><span class=\"frac-den\">130</span></span>＞1，民航≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">230</span><span class=\"frac-den\">250</span></span>＞0.9，公路营业性≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">3500</span><span class=\"frac-den\">4100</span></span>，水路、民航明显下降幅度较小，铁路和公路营业性，<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">3500-1800</span><span class=\"frac-den\">4100-2300</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">1700</span><span class=\"frac-den\">1800</span></span>，公路营业性降幅＞铁路降幅，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":15,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>A选项：10月1日流动量为33578.84万人次，10月4日流动量为30129.11万人，环比下降1.1%，则10月3日流动量≈30129.11+30129.11×1.1%≈30400，前半程累计约为12.43亿人次，10月2日流动量≈12.4-3.3-3.0-3.0≈3.1亿人次，10月1日流动量最大，正确；B选项：公路人员流动量与全社会跨区域人员流动量增速相近，可用现期比代替基期比，公路出行占比≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">27873</span><span class=\"frac-den\">30129</span></span>＞90%，起主导作用，正确；C选项：10月3日和4日，铁路环比增速为0.9%，公路环比增速为-1.2%，水路环比增速为-0.9%，民航环比增速为-1.8%，变化幅度不大，正确；D选项：比较增量可以比较现期×增速，铁路客运量现期2313.2约是水路客运量现期132.15的20+倍，而水路客运量增速20.5%不到铁路客运量增速7.9%的3倍，因此铁路客运量增量＞水路客运量增量，不正确；所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。---# 10. 2020-2025联考资料分析文字解析## 真题解析：2020-2025年联考资料分析</p>"}]}